-- #486 (ARC: 30x24 additive; generated by lib/map-zones.ts gridGrowthSql): adds the 288 squares of the 30x24 grid outside the old 24x18 grid.
-- Insert-only: ON CONFLICT (x,y) DO NOTHING, no UPDATE or DELETE, so no existing row changes. These 288 rows are FROZEN: never edit this file or regenerate it; later grid or terrain changes need a new migration.
-- D1/SQLite: the D1 boot seed (lib/db.ts) adds these rows only from #486 slice 3, when WORLD_GRID becomes 30x24; this slice changes Postgres only.
-- Deploy note: once 0066 is on the shared database, the #501 guard (assertDatabaseNotAhead) refuses any production deploy of a release without 0066. Rollback floor (#726): --rollback refuses any target whose workers/tag commit is missing or does not contain #724's merge 36fe66ed8682286c0178ea6b4ecf19a49877060c; this floor is the one check a rollback never skips.
